{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_05",
  "title": "風雨欲來",
  "storyCode": "WB-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e2d0540d5667b7d7d02169292a16603a5ea7b25491f5bbfae798fa870cb03660",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g1_yumenstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "日漸西斜。\n人和城牆的影子都被拉得很長。影子蓋過了路邊的鋪面，店家便收起陽傘，伸了一個漫長的懶腰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慵懶的攤販",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後幾件，七折清倉，賣完回家吃飯嘍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的攤販",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去吧，還惦記著賣你那沒開刃的兵器模型啊，現在的遊客早就不吃那套了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慵懶的攤販",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要真會鑄劍的手藝，肯定也得去軍營裡做些大事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的攤販",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，昨天我還真見到一個遊客佩著一把赤紅色的劍，看起來真不一般。也不知道是從哪搞來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女茫然地看著四周。眼前盡是從未見過的景象。\n腳下地面傳來隱隱的震動感，大概是移動城市減速的徵兆。但路上的行人卻似乎習以為常，有條不紊地做著平常的事。\n晚飯的香氣鑽入鼻腔。少女這才想起，自己已經整整兩天沒有吃過東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "渾身的酸痛隨著餓意一起襲來。\n雙腿也不聽自己使喚，跟著香味走向了一家飯館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人要點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旁邊那桌人吃的......我也要一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，三號桌烤肉涼麵一份——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "臨近晚飯的時間，店裡已經差不多坐滿。對於樸實的人們來說，忙碌了一天后，一頓踏實的晚飯，就是最好的慰藉。\n牆上的電視機裡迴圈播放著刀光劍影的故事，偶有食客抬起頭，被熟悉的橋段吸引一陣注意力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這個盒子裡的人，為什麼看起來和他一模一樣？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他旁邊的女俠，和師父有點像，又不太像......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（“故事由真實事件改編”又是什麼意思......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客官您的麵來了，慢用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就說應該送一幅百米長卷，讓城裡每個人都簽上名字，這樣的餞別禮物才有意義！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是傻，宗師是要走的，這麼大一件東西你讓他怎麼帶得走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正都是心意，不如多備點我們這裡的特色美食，還實在一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說......那位宗師到底守了玉門多少年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "具體我也說不清楚，只知道我爹那一輩的人出生的時候，宗師就已經守在這了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他豈不是已經有一百多歲了？怪不得要離任，應該是身體吃不消了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我聽一些江湖人說，就在前陣子還有人見過他。看上去就是一副平常中年男人的樣貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位宗師，不是正常人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說這世上有些人，就是有用法術延年益壽的本事，宗師他大概也是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管他到底是什麼人，我們只要記得他是守護玉門城的大英雄，住在這的人，都應該記著他的好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只可惜，從來沒有聽說宗師他有過婚配，或是有一兒半女的。明明左將軍的公子都這麼大了，真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他們說，那個人是......英雄？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘，這飯也吃完了......還算合口味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，很好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這飯錢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來付吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝、謝謝你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒沒什麼啦......真巧，又見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是弄丟了錢包，還是忘了帶夠錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......弄丟了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？真倒楣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來你也是剛來的樣子，應該對這裡也不熟悉。我和你一起去報官吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你的好意，還是不用了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次的飯錢，我回頭會還給你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你帶著的這把劍......就是你之前說過，要找的那把？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要搶嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼會平白無故搶別人的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我聽說，最近城中有一把很特殊的劍失竊，該不會就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先告辭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說不能和習武之人開這種玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況是世上所有習武之人裡練得最刻苦、最厲害的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他要是一個條件反射，閉著眼對我一拳揮過來，我是不是就要交待在這了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也只好把他抓起來，判一個過失殺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人，怎麼說，剛才那個賭該算我贏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......確實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛才和梁洵打賭，就賭你進門看見我倆是什麼反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他賭你會扭頭就走，我賭你會愣在原地一句話都講不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "論看人的本事，我也從來沒見過有誰能勝過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況還不是別人，是我的結義兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，槐琥不知道你在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是再不解風情，也知道該為父女重逢好好準備一個合適的場合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不像旁邊這位知府大人，有十幾年沒見面，找我的第一件事就把我捲進了一個天大的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那件事，的確是我虧欠你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再數落你，算不算指桑駡槐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，這沒有別人，就我們三兄弟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我準備了酒和菜，坐下來聊聊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g10_yumenfair"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按小姐給的情報，所有可疑倉庫的地址都發到你們的終端上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從東到西，一個個去查。時間緊張，手腳快一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查到情況不要輕舉妄動，先跟大夥聯絡，我們一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那人反應很快，在道上摸爬滾打了許多年，他分得清什麼時候該打，什麼時候該逃。\n可是他剛轉過身去，就察覺到一隻手輕輕搭在他的肩頭，僅是這樣，他就再也動彈不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然要找我，為什麼又要逃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門遊客？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小夥子辦事挺機靈，但少了點膽魄。改了這個毛病，將來或許能另有成就。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人緩緩收回了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去告訴你家林特使，今天申時正，城南五街七坊倉庫。我等她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不喝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還沒到下班的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也不喝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底對身體不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不喝酒，也不說話，這三雙眼睛乾瞪著算怎麼回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人剛剛不還說有話要問他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之間不借酒，有些話也說不出口了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有話直說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這些年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊歷四方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到一個地方就找能一戰的對手，直到找不到為止。然後就再換一個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前見到梁大人，我還要細細揣摩一下這些年他的變化。槐武癡的變化，倒是直接寫在臉上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡變了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是廢話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也真的擔心過，要是哪天突然得知你死於和別人的交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有道是，人外有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你最終到了玉門......有多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡有人答應與我比武。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "短則三五年，長則十餘年。他是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初說要爭一個天下聞名的槐天裴，居然也會這樣......耐得住寂寞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正找不到別的對手，在這邊等幾年又何妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你就在這家醫館當了三年夥計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒倒入杯中，香氣卻被藥味蓋過。酒入愁腸，嘴裡只剩苦味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“白頭翁”“刀傷木”“羽不泊”“千里及”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在玉門武行打聽了大半月，卻怎麼也沒有想到，你就在客棧對面的這家醫館裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欠了債，總是要還的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你也該清楚，在這世上你虧欠最多的人是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得，我要說的話已經說完了，梁大人還有什麼話要問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來探望老朋友，看看他過得怎麼樣，不該算“問話”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "槐天裴在玉門待了三年，你來到玉門也有些時日，偏偏選這個時候來探望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城中風波未定，不是顧及私情的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人一心為國，還不允許我們這些老百姓有些私情了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們要是誠心想敘舊，我就再坐上一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐天裴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說句話也不自在，我們怎麼變成了這副樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "槐天裴端起了面前的酒，一飲而盡，轉身離開了房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人，得到想要的答案了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是作為槐天裴的義弟，還是作為玉門參知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也該習慣了總是被你看透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許你該改改總是招攬麻煩事的習慣，至少別讓自己連個能說話的人都找不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一件事，他或許是恰當的人選......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像上次你挑我來送那個盞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒那麼複雜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他還是那個槐天裴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是最難變的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你我呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欲買桂花同載酒，終不似，少年游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還能坐在一張桌子上聊上幾句喝一杯酒，就已經是難能可貴的事。非要找回過去的那段日子，反倒像是刻舟求劍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g6_yumengate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要攔我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩天發生了許多事，我也沒有搞太清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你沒有惡意，最好能留下來，幫忙把事情說清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交出手裡的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些人是跟著你過來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不認識他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幾天，在城裡到處作亂的人，就是你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知死活的小——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這個人......之前和我比武的時候，難道還沒有盡全力嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些壞人，只有這點實力，為什麼還敢這麼倡狂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
